        "checksum": "9af14ec91eb98f04ebbc84572fb6f7a7addabe1b3795f5cd0bd3ed6f119a4df7_1_1_1_0__1",
        "gg25q_8Iur7_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0735/4833/3323/files/hf_20260501_063757_bc718745-9c86-4432-92cf-e7d7df5d7b1d.png",
        "gg29c8vEJbO_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#FF0000;\"><strong>LIMITED TIME DEAL</strong>:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);color:#000000;\">BUY 2 GET 2 FREE + GIFTS</span></p>",
        "ggD4sCBXjJ8_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Plaque is a sticky film. A smooth surface slides right over it. FreshWipes have a raised, textured surface that physically grips and lifts bacteria off the tooth. That's the step most products skip entirely — and why the problem keeps coming back.</span></p>",
        "ggDHwZ6UpAu_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0735/4833/3323/files/hf_20260501_065323_4f1cd1bf-ac2d-41a8-9c18-e73c1560e13d.png",
        "ggLICBecN9b_text": "7 Reasons Dog Owners Who've Tried Every Dental Care Routine Are Finally Switching to Anti-Bacterial Finger Wipes",
        "ggNTPQ8wLjg_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">A toothbrush is a foreign object coming at his face. Your finger isn't. They spent years learning that your hand means safety. When the tool is your finger, the resistance that usually starts before you even begin — just doesn't.</span></p>",
        "ggO4JaexPTG_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Dogs build resistance over time. Give them 45 seconds and they've made up their mind. Finger wipes are done before that window closes. Fast enough that most dogs don't even register it as something to resist.</span></p>",
        "ggTU4r1vY9M_dayLabel": "Days",
        "ggTU4r1vY9M_hourLabel": "HRS",
        "ggTU4r1vY9M_minuteLabel": "MIN",
        "ggTU4r1vY9M_secondLabel": "SEC",
        "ggTU4r1vY9M_weekLabel": "Weeks",
        "ggUBLlfBle8_text": "2. <span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>TEXTURE IS WHAT ACTUALLY REMOVES PLAQUE — NOT PASTE</strong></span>",
        "ggeNjSpdq-N_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#FF0000;\"><strong>LIMITED TIME DEAL</strong>:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);color:#000000;\">BUY 2 GET 2 + FREE GIFTS</span></p>",
        "ggeTLH_WG1X_text": "<p>Last Updated April 13, 2026</p>",
        "ggk-TckENJt_text": "<strong>1. </strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>YOUR FINGER IS ALREADY SOMETHING HE TRUSTS</strong></span>",
        "gglLysVGf5L_dayLabel": "Days",
        "gglLysVGf5L_hourLabel": "HRS",
        "gglLysVGf5L_minuteLabel": "MIN",
        "gglLysVGf5L_secondLabel": "SEC",
        "gglLysVGf5L_weekLabel": "Weeks",
        "ggpUmVIWk0y_text": "3. <span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>IT'S DONE IN 30 SECONDS BEFORE THEY DECIDE THEY HATE IT</strong></span>",
        "ggsaFuKxlsz_text": "<p>You know their teeth needs cleaning. You just can't get near them.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Every day you skip it, the buildup gets a little worse. And somewhere in the back of your mind — you know it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Here's why finger wipes (and not the ordinary ones, anti-bacterial finger wipes) work when the toothbrush never did.</p>",
        "ggt322ExnHo_text": "By Margaret L.",
        "ggugDv32GE1_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0735/4833/3323/files/360_F_379253282_e3Id5exRs29FkuiooSPUHz82UIirNNsr.jpg",
        "ggwhx8v4ZGX_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#FF0000;\"><strong>LIMITED-TIME FATHER'S DAY SALE</strong>:</span> <span style=\"background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);color:#000000;\">BUY 2 GET 2 + FREE GIFTS</span></p>",
